      <para> In Step 12, what is the number of small squares?</para>
        <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! Step 12 has 146 small squares.</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <!--END QUESTION.-->
  <!--Do not edit below line.-->
  <solution>
